{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n \n 残酷な観客達の最終回に\n 私たちひらがなけやきも出演させてもらいます！\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6CMRQE6F4FBVFTE1DAAC4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6CNS4KKR6X380F33KKKA9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 初めてのドラマ出演でした！\n \n \n \n 小さい頃からドラマが大好きで\n テレビといったらドラマってくらい\n ドラマを見ていたので\n 実際にドラマの現場に行って\n 出演することができて\n とっても嬉しかったです٩(^‿^)۶\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6CPQY8EWE8JEPGDHFA2HH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n 漢字さんが着ていた制服を\n 私も着ることができました！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6CQPE1H628F5P27BVY43X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 台本も用意してもらいました！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6CRMY2HG8W6GV0HJJYRWW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n このような撮り方を女優さんがよくしているのを見かけていて、私もしてみたかったのでして見ました。\n \n ちょっと嬉しくなりました。\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6CSHX8SG7NCPAK5SV5JP8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH6CTHAA8SSR0Z6ZENB9M8S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n とっても嬉しかったです！\n \n 最終回楽しみです٩(^‿^)۶"}],"source":"archive"}